  "Which term includes concepts, experience, and insight that provide a framework for creating, evaluating, and using information?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-red-500 bg-red-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A Wisdom.\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B Define knowledge work systems and describe the generic requirements of knowledge work systems.\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C Knowledge management is a business process, not a technology.\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> D Knowledge.\nD",
  "Which of the following the key stages involved in organizational knowledge capture?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-red-500 bg-red-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A Grafting.\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B Vicarious learning.\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C Experiential learning.\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> D Inferential processes.\nE. E type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> E All of the above.\nE",
  "The \"Grand Vision\" of AI remains a distant dream: Human intelligence is vastly more complex than the most sophisticated computer programs and covers a broader range of activities than is currently possible with \"intelligent\" computer systems and devices.\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A Artificial intelligence (AI)\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B an expert system\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C computer systems that think and act like humans\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> D an expert system is an intelligent technique for capturing tacit knowledge in a very specific and limited domain of human expertise\nA",
  "Which of the following is INCORRECT in relation to Transformation?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-red-500 bg-red-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A It involves a change in the way things are done and in the basic assumptions of the organisation.\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B It aims to achieve a dramatic improvement in performance and alter a company's future trajectory.\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C It requires change in the way an organization is managed, in its business processes and in the behavior of its people.\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> D It can be handled within the existing paradigm and routines of the enterprise.\nD",
