  "Which of the following does NOT determines the nature of Progress?\nA. A type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-red-500 bg-red-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> A It is an improvement in the well-being of an individual, organization or nation.\nB. B type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> B It means better and longer quality of life.\nC. C type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-slate-200 hover:border-primary/50\" disabled> C It involves change but every change is not progress.\nD. D type=\"button\" class=\"w-full rounded-xl border bg-white px-4 py-3 text-left transition-all cursor-not-allowed border-green-500 bg-green-50/50 shadow-2xs\" disabled> D It maintains the gap between what human beings are and what they want to be.\nD",
